Created and verified exactly two output files:

- `/workspace/out/root_cause.json`
- `/workspace/out/triage_notes.md`

The supplied `<HOME>/...` paths were unavailable in this Linux environment; the fixtures were present under `/workspace/in`, so outputs were written to the corresponding `/workspace/out` directory.

